# m7_rank (M7 rank, PLAN.md M7 "Rank"): rank = stage base (0 / 150 / 300 / 450) + 400 x loop
# + seconds into the stage (at most 120) + 50 per weapon level above 1 + 50 per fork - mercy,
# clamped to 0..1000; mercy (World) is +80 at each auto-rewind resume (and each probe hit),
# capped at 240, -1 every 30 ticks. Input: m1_play's sweep (A at 30, up 40 / hold 20 / down
# 40 / hold 20 to 1800) in a normal game, debug_next_stage three times at 500 (stage 1 ->
# STAGING -> ... -> PRODUCTION, stage index 3) and debug_probe at 1270, once the three
# rewinds are spent.
# - Stage time: rank 0 at the start, 2 at 150 (game tick 120: the STAGE pop runs at the real
#   pace). Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (waves.zig: while fewer than 3 enemies are on the
#   field the stage clock runs 4 ticks a tick): rank 3 at 210, then the first string is shot
#   down and the clock races, 4 at 231 (1 s of stage time in 21 ticks); 5 at 300 (game tick
#   270; 4 until the catch-up), 12 at 432 (game tick 402; 6 until then).
# - Weapon level: the F crate at 433 makes F2: rank 12 -> 62.
# - Stage: at 500 the jump to stage 4 resets the stage clock: 450 + 50 = 500; it rises with
#   the stage clock again (501 at 560, 502 at 620, 504 at 757).
# - A rewound hit: hit at 758 (rewinds 2), resume at 838 at game tick 608 (rank 502 there);
#   the resume charges the power loss (F2 -> F1, -50) and mercy 80: rank 502 -> 372.
# - Two more rewound hits (914, 1178): the third resume (1258) lands after the earlier ones,
#   so the mercy adds up: 78 -> 158, rank 374 -> 294. The power loss floors: forks stay 0 at
#   every resume (838, 1258), and the third resume finds F1 and leaves it (weapon 1).
# - Probe mode from 1270 (no rewinds left; a probe hit charges the same power loss and
#   mercy at once): 1364 mercy 154 -> 234 (rank 300 -> 220); 1424 mercy 232 -> 240, not 312:
#   the cap (rank 223 -> 215); 1511 237 -> 240 again.
# debug_history_check is 0 across the stage jump, after each resume and after the probe toggle.
--frames 1800 --call-at "500 debug_next_stage" --call-at "500 debug_next_stage" --call-at "500 debug_next_stage" --call-at "1270 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_rank,debug_mercy,debug_stage_index,debug_hits --at "31 debug_rank == 0" --at "150 debug_rank == 2" --at "210 debug_rank == 3" --at "230 debug_rank == 3" --at "231 debug_rank == 4" --at "300 debug_rank == 5" --at "432 debug_rank == 12" --at "432 debug_weapon == 1" --at "433 debug_weapon == 2" --at "433 debug_rank == 62" --at "500 debug_stage_index == 3" --at "500 debug_rank == 500" --at "560 debug_rank == 501" --at "620 debug_rank == 502" --at "757 debug_rank == 504" --at "758 debug_state == 4" --at "758 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "837 debug_rank == 502" --at "837 debug_mercy == 0" --at "838 debug_state == 1" --at "838 debug_weapon == 1" --at "838 debug_mercy == 80" --at "838 debug_rank == 372" --at "1257 debug_mercy == 78" --at "1258 debug_mercy == 158" --at "1258 debug_rank == 294" --at "1258 debug_rewinds == 0" --at "838 debug_forks == 0" --at "1257 debug_weapon == 1" --at "1258 debug_weapon == 1" --at "1258 debug_forks == 0" --at "1363 debug_mercy == 154" --at "1364 debug_hits == 1" --at "1364 debug_mercy == 234" --at "1364 debug_rank == 220" --at "1423 debug_mercy == 232" --at "1424 debug_hits == 2" --at "1424 debug_mercy == 240" --at "1424 debug_rank == 215" --at "1510 debug_mercy == 237" --at "1511 debug_mercy == 240" --at "510 debug_history_check == 0" --at "700 debug_history_check == 0" --at "850 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1260 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1430 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1799 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_mercy <= 240"
